invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_ifma.c
catches: rsa_ifma_model_test
reason: normalize_digits adds a carry only to the lanes directly above a
  lane that generates one, so a lane at 2^52 - 1 keeps a carry that
  should pass through it and the lane above it gets none.
  bin/rsa_ifma_model_test's run of normalize_digits on lanes at
  2^52 - 1 sees the number change.

--- old
        rsa_ifma_lane_bits receives = (rsa_ifma_lane_bits)((total ^ propagate) & 0xffU);
--- new
        rsa_ifma_lane_bits receives = (rsa_ifma_lane_bits)shifted;
